    "description": "<h1><a name=\"Headingone\"></a>Heading one</h1>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Headingthree\"></a>Heading three</h3>\n\n<p>Plain, <b>bold</b>, <em>italic</em>, <del>struck</del>, <tt>code</tt>, <a href=\"https://example.com/page\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">a link</a>, emoji :smile: and unicode: żółć 日本語 🚀<br/>\nafter break</p>\n\n<p><font color=\"#ff5630\">Colored</font> H~2~ <ins>underlined</ins> <tt>2026-01-01</tt> <font color=\"#36B37E\"><b>[ READY ]</b></font></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>bullet one</li>\n\t<li>bullet two\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>nested</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<ol>\n\t<li>third</li>\n\t<li>fourth</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><del>done task</del></li>\n\t<li>todo task</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre>var x = 1;\nConsole.WriteLine(x);</pre>\n</div></div>\n\n<blockquote><p>quoted</p></blockquote>\n\n<div class=\"panel\" style=\"background-color: #fffae6;border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"panelContent\" style=\"background-color: #fffae6;\">\n<p>panel text</p>\n</div></div>\n\n<hr />\n\n<div class='table-wrap'>\n<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>H1</th>\n<th class='confluenceTh'>H2</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>a</td>\n<td class='confluenceTd'>b</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><b>Expand me</b></p>\n\n<p>hidden</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://example.com/card\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://example.com/card</a></p>"
